OL,3,GNEWSARed Arrows to take to skies for
OL,4,ATour of Britain
OL,5,
OL,6,FCraig Leyland, leader of East Lindsey
OL,7,FDistrict Council, added: "The sight of
OL,8,Fthese legendary aircraft flying above
OL,9,Fand the spectacle of dozens of riders
OL,10,Fracing on two wheels below will be an
OL,11,Fawe-inspiring sight."
